# Frontend build configuration. Copy to .env.local for development.
#
# Leave these UNSET and the app builds in demo mode: no sign-in, the role
# switcher in the topbar, and the in-memory dataset. That is what the public
# demo on GitHub Pages is, and it is the safe default — a missing variable
# cannot accidentally produce an unauthenticated real deployment, because
# without a project there is no real data to reach.
#
# Set both and the app requires a Supabase session before any route renders.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Single sign-on buttons to offer: google, azure (Microsoft Entra), github.
# Each must also be enabled under Authentication -> Providers in Supabase;
# listing one here only decides whether the button is drawn.
VITE_SSO_PROVIDERS=google,azure
